  },
  {
   "id": "271559ec25268bb9",
   "workspace_id": "1629dee48cc4e531",
   "title": "指标口径说明",
   "content": "晶圆出货量 = sum(lot_quantity)，统计当期已产出并出货的晶圆片数。\n良品芯片数 = sum(good_die)，通过最终电测（sort test）的芯片数量。\n综合良率 = sum(good_die) / sum(gross_die)，按总产出芯片口径而非单片计量。\n晶圆营收 = sum(revenue)，按出货批次计价，单位为万元，含税。\n单片营收 = 晶圆营收 / 晶圆出货量，反映单片价值量与产品结构。\n出货客户数 = count(distinct customer_id)，按自然月去重。",
   "source_type": "manual",
   "tags": "指标",
   "scope": "workspace",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00"
  },
  {
   "id": "af75c71ac23e1156",
   "workspace_id": "1629dee48cc4e531",
   "title": "业务术语表",
   "content": "晶圆 Wafer：芯片制造的圆形硅衬底，按片计。\n晶圆厂 Fab：半导体制造工厂，按所在地与制程定位区分。\n制程节点：如 7nm / 28nm，决定特征尺寸与良率水平。\n良率 Yield：合格芯片 / 总芯片，关键成本与产能指标。\n光刻 / CMP / 电测 Sort：晶圆制造关键工序与最终测试，测试决定 good_die 口径。",
   "source_type": "manual",
   "tags": "术语",
   "scope": "workspace",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00"
  },
  {
   "id": "b2341b7b98aa9592",
   "workspace_id": "1629dee48cc4e531",
   "title": "敏感数据与合规要求",
   "content": "客户名单、晶圆厂内部制程与良率数据属于商业机密（Corporate Confidential），对外须脱敏与授权。\n跨境流动：涉及海外客户的营收与出货明细需遵循出口管制与数据跨境合规要求。\n厂区/型号/良率等工程数据导出需数据管理员审批，并记录审计日志。\n合规框架：参考出口管制清单（ECCN）与个人/商业数据最小化原则。",
   "source_type": "manual",
   "tags": "合规",
   "scope": "workspace",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00"
  }
 ],
 "flows": [
  {
   "id": "cff5497121104c2b",
   "workspace_id": "1629dee48cc4e531",
   "name": "每日晶圆产出刷新",
   "description": "示例工作流：产出汇总 → 质量校验 → 良率贡献，每天 07:00 调度",
   "nodes": "[{\"id\": \"n1\", \"type\": \"sql\", \"name\": \"构建每日产出汇总\", \"config\": {\"sql\": \"SELECT wip_date, sum(lot_quantity) AS wafer_out, sum(good_die) AS good_die, round(sum(good_die)*1.0/nullif(sum(gross_die),0)*100,2) AS yield_pct FROM demo.semi.fact_wafer_out GROUP BY wip_date ORDER BY wip_date\"}}, {\"id\": \"n2\", \"type\": \"quality\", \"name\": \"校验良率范围\", \"config\": {\"sql\": \"SELECT count(*) AS bad FROM demo.semi.fact_wafer_out WHERE yield_pct < 0 OR yield_pct > 100\"}}, {\"id\": \"n3\", \"type\": \"sql\", \"name\": \"输出制程良率贡献\", \"config\": {\"sql\": \"SELECT p.process_node, round(sum(f.good_die)*1.0/nullif(sum(f.gross_die),0)*100,2) AS yield_pct, sum(f.revenue) AS revenue FROM demo.semi.fact_wafer_out f JOIN demo.semi.dim_product p ON p.product_id = f.product_id GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY revenue DESC\"}}]",
   "edges": "[[\"n1\", \"n2\"], [\"n2\", \"n3\"]]",
   "cron": "0 7 * * *",
   "enabled": 1,
   "retries": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00",
   "updated_at": "2026-11-10T12:28:05+08:00"
  }
 ],
